ערש.\nבן ר' אהרן לוריא און מרת מרים (שפירא)","links":[{"t":"ANU – Museum of די Jewish People, Famil","u":"https://dbs.anumuseum.org.il/skn/c6/d/e24200823"}],"mes":1,"inh":"unv","inhw":"הרבנית שפרה וואגשאל (≈ נאמען פון געני)"},"ms_0d1879712c":{"id":"ms_0d1879712c","n":"מרת מרים (שפירא)","t":"לויט מסורה · ווייב פון ר' אהרן בן ר' נתנאל לוריא","m":"inf","br":"M","src":"Neil Rosenstein, \"Ashkenazic Rabbinic Families\" (דזשואיש-גען Rav-SIG)","x":"\"His son, Mattithiah Treves, after studying in Spain, became Rabbi of Paris by royal decree in 1363. The first union of these two great rabbinical families was the marriage of Mattithiah's daughter to R. Solomon Spira. A daughter of this issue, Miriam, united her ancestry with that of the Luria family by marrying R. Aaron, son of Nethaneel Luria.\"\nראזענשטיין: \"Even though he [Epstein] misrepresents the Spira-Luria lineage\" – די קייט איז נישט אומגעשטריטן.\nטאכטער פון ר' שלמה שפירא און בת ר' מתתיהו טריוויש","links":[{"t":"Neil Rosenstein, \"Ashkenazic Rabbinic Fa","u":"https://www.jewishgen.org/rabbinic/journal/ashkenazic.htm"}],"mes":1,"inh":"unv","inhw":"הרבנית שפרה וואגשאל (≈ נאמען פון געני)"},"ms_e70a8e4a21":{"id":"ms_e70a8e4a21","n":"ר' שלמה שפירא","t":"לויט מסורה","m":"inf","br":"M","src":"Rosenstein (ibid.)","x":"\"His son, Mattithiah Treves, after studying in Spain, became Rabbi of Paris by royal decree in 1363. The first union of these two great rabbinical families was the marriage of Mattithiah's daughter to R. Solomon Spira. A daughter of this issue, Miriam, united her ancestry with that of the Luria family by marrying R. Aaron, son of Nethaneel Luria.\"\nמאן פון בת ר' מתתיהו טריוויש; די רש\"י-ליניע גייט דורך דער ווייב","links":[{"t":"Rosenstein (ibid.)","u":"https://www.jewishgen.org/rabbinic/journal/ashkenazic.htm"}],"mes":1,"inh":"unv","inhw":"הרבנית שפרה וואגשאל (≈ נאמען פון געני)"},"ms_f529cda963":{"id":"ms_f529cda963","n":"בת ר' מתתיהו טריוויש","t":"לויט מסורה · ווייב פון ר' שלמה שפירא","m":"inf","br":"M","sr